      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a B2B sales research assistant. Analyze the lead below and enrich it.\n\nLead information:\n- Full Name: {{ $json[\"Full Name\"] }}\n- Company Name: {{ $json[\"Company Name\"] }}\n- Email: {{ $json.Email }}\n- Job Title: {{ $json[\"Job Title\"] }}\n- Website: {{ $json.Website }}\n\nInstructions:\n- Company Summary: 2-3 sentences describing what the company does.\n- Industry: the primary industry.\n- Company Size: one of Small, Medium, Large, or Unknown.\n- Qualification: likelihood of being a good B2B customer — one of High, Medium, or Low.\n- Pain Points: a list of likely business pain points.\n- Outreach Angle: a personalized first outreach angle for this specific lead.\n- Lead Score: an integer from 0 to 100.\n- Reasoning: a short justification for the score.\nBase your analysis only on the information provided and reasonable inference. If unsure about size, use \"Unknown\".",
